er_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_endpoint_get_claim_card", "label": "GET /api/v1/claims/:id/card", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/06-api-and-ui.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "P1: compact JSON plus HTML fragment so integrations need no graph logic."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_endpoint_get_source_card", "label": "GET /api/v1/sources/:id/card", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/06-api-and-ui.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "P1."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_claim_score_digest", "label": "claim_score_digest", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/06-api-and-ui.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "sha256 over the sorted (claim_id, trace_hash) list at a seq under the default model; two installations with the same log must return the same digest."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_answer_card", "label": "Answer card", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/06-api-and-ui.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The default claim view. Users read 0.73 as '73% true' no matter how it is labeled, so the probability, trace and graph live behind Show calculation and Why?, and the number is available but never the headline."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_main_unresolved_issue", "label": "Main unresolved issue", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/06-api-and-ui.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.5a", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chosen deterministically, first match wins: an invalidated or disputed audit; independence_unreviewed > 0; a QUALIFY link; contested; the first unmet review check; otherwise 'none recorded'."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_display_rules", "label": "Display Rules (normative)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/06-api-and-ui.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lead with the compact answer, never the graph or the number; no number at all for INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE or NOT_APPLICABLE; review coverage always as a count of checks; no persuasive framing, colour-coding, debunked/confirmed badges or ranking of claims by wrongness."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_model_selector", "label": "Model selector", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/06-api-and-ui.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Always available next to the assessment; the default model is labeled as a default, not as 'the' answer (Art. XIX)."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_personal_belief_display_rule", "label": "Personal belief is never styled as an assessment", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/06-api-and-ui.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A